<title>USA: Washington $81 mln GOs repriced, yields lowered.</title>
<headline>Washington $81 mln GOs repriced, yields lowered.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Smith Barney Inc said Wednesday it repriced Washington's $81.2 million general obligation bond issue, lowering yields in the 2015 and 2017 maturities.</p>
<p>The repricing follows:</p>
<p>STATE OF WASHINGTON</p>
<p>RE: $81,215,000*</p>
<p>GENERAL OBLIGATION</p>
<p>REFUNDING BONDS, SERIES R-97A</p>
<p>(STATE TRADE AND CONVENTION CENTER</p>
<p>ZERO COUPON BONDS)</p>
<p>VERBAL AWARD.</p>
<p>   MOODY'S: Aa		    S&amp;P: AA		    FITCH: AA</p>
<p>DUE: 07/01</p>
<p>DATED (zeros): Date of Delivery</p>
<p>								    APPROX.</p>
<p>								    $ PRICE</p>
<p>		     PRINCIPAL     MATURITY  YIELD TO     PER</p>
<p> MATURITY	   AMOUNT*	VALUE     MATURITY    $100</p>
<p>07/01/2015	 5,620,988.80   16,240M    5.825     34.612</p>
<p>07/01/2016	 5,283,848.70   16,245M    5.85	32.526</p>
<p>07/01/2017	 4,987,864.80   16,245M    5.85	30.704</p>
<p>07/01/2018	 4,683,920.85   16,245M    5.875     28.833</p>
<p>07/01/2019	 4,419,066.40   16,240M    5.875     27.211</p>
<p>CALL FEATURES: NON-CALLABLE</p>
<p>* - APPROXIMATE SUBJECT TO CHANGE</p>
<p>The compliance addendum MSRB Rule G-11 will apply.</p>
<p>The award is expected Thursday, December 19, 1996.</p>
<p>Delivery is expected on January 9, 1997.</p>
<p>This issue is book entry through DTC.</p>
<p>Smith Barney Inc.</p>
<p>Merrill Lynch &amp; Co.</p>
<p>Dain Bosworth Incorporated</p>
<p>Goldman, Sachs &amp; Co.</p>
<p>Lehman Brothers</p>
<p>PaineWebber Incorporated</p>
<p>Prudential Securities Incorporated</p>
<p>Seattle-First National Bank</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
